[h2]Credits[/h2]

Based on [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3491510356]Realistic Clothes[/url] by [b]Gootube[/b], including its sounds. Rewritten for Build 42.21 with multiplayer support, then expanded with shoe sizes, patterns, sewing machines, dyeing and embroidery. Tooltips by [b]TooltipLib[/b].
Sewing machine sounds: electric machine by Joseph Sardin ([url=https://bigsoundbank.com]BigSoundBank[/url], CC0); treadle machine by Work With Sounds / Museum of Municipal Engineering ([url=https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:WWS_Glovemakermachinesewing2.ogg]Wikimedia Commons[/url], [url=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/]CC BY 4.0[/url]), trimmed into loops.
Source code (MIT) on [url=https://github.com/cyberbobjr/MyTailorIsRich]GitHub[/url].
